      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA PETROLEUM (CUKAI PENDAPATAN) 1967 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 25 mula berkuat kuasa apabila berkuatkuasanya Akta ini."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_24",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 26 mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2015. Pindaan seksyen 39"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967, yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Bab ini, dipinda dalam seksyen 39 dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (4) subseksyen yang berikut: “(5) The Director General, where for any year of assessment it appears to him that no or no sufficient assessment has been made on a chargeable person chargeable to tax in consequence of the Director General’s determination pursuant to subsection 72a(3), may in that year or within seven years after its expiration make an assessment or additional assessment, as the case may be, in respect of that chargeable person in the amount or additional amount of chargeable income and tax or in the additional amount of tax in which, according to the best of the Director General’s judgment, the assessment with respect to that chargeable person ought to have been made for that year.”. Pindaan seksyen 49a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 49a(16) Akta ibu dipinda dalam takrif “due date” dengan menggantikan perkataan “tenth” dengan perkataan “fifteenth”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 60i Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: “(3a) For the purposes of subsections (1) and (3), the company referred to in those sections shall include a unit trust which is approved by the Securities Commission as Real Estate Investment Trust or Property Trust Fund.”. Pindaan seksyen 75b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 75B Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: “(3) Where in a year of assessment, a partnership or a company has converted into a limited liability partnership in accordance with the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2012— (a) every partner of the partnership shall continue to be personally assessable and chargeable to tax for that year of assessment and for any previous year of assessment before the conversion in respect of his chargeable income for any such year of assessment; and (b) the limited liability partnership shall be assessable and chargeable to tax for that year of assessment and for any previous year of assessment before the conversion in respect of the chargeable income of the company for any such year of assessment. (4) Where the limited liability partnership is so assessable and chargeable under paragraph (3)(b), it shall be assessable and chargeable to tax in like manner and to the like amount as the company would have been assessed and charged to tax prior to the conversion.”. Pindaan seksyen 77c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 77c(1) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (a), dengan memotong perkataan “other than gains or profits in respect of the use or enjoyment of benefits provided by his employer under paragraph 13(1)(b) or (1)(c)”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (c), dengan memotong perkataan “for a period of twelve months”. Pindaan seksyen 91"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 91 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (4) subseksyen yang berikut: “(5) The Director General, where for any year of assessment it appears to him that no or no sufficient assessment has been made on a person chargeable to tax in consequence of the Director General’s determination pursuant to subsection 140a(3), may in that year or within seven years after its expiration make an assessment or additional assessment, as the case may be, in respect of that person in the amount or additional amount of chargeable income and tax or in the additional amount of tax in which, according to the best of the Director General’s judgment, the assessment with respect to that person ought to have been made for that year.”. Pindaan seksyen 99"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 99(4) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “section 138a” perkataan “or any practice of the Director General generally prevailing at the time when the assessment is made”. Pindaan seksyen 107c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 107c Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (4a), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “where a company” perkataan “resident and incorporated in Malaysia”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (12), dalam takrif “due date” dengan menggantikan perkataan “tenth” dengan perkataan “fifteenth”. Seksyen baru 110c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 110B seksyen yang berikut: “Set-off for tax charged on actuarial surplus under takaful business 110c. (1) Notwithstanding section 110, where for a basis period for a year of assessment an amount of actuarial surplus from the family fund of an operator is transferred to the shareholders’ fund pursuant to subparagraph 60aa(9)(a)(vi) or 60aa(10)(a)(vi), any amount of tax charged on the portion of that surplus shall be set off against the tax charged on the chargeable income from the shareholders’ fund of that operator in respect of the family business. (2) Where— (a) tax is set off under this section against the tax charged on the chargeable income of an operator from its shareholders’ fund in respect of family business for a year of assessment and the amount of the tax set-off exceeds the tax charged for that year, the excess shall be disregarded; or (b) there is no tax charged for that year, so much of the amount of tax that would otherwise be set off but for the absence of such tax charged shall be disregarded. (3) For the purposes of this section, tax charged on the chargeable income of an operator from its shareholders’ fund in respect of family business shall consist of an amount of tax before taking into account the tax set-off under section 110. (4) The portion of the surplus referred to in subsection (1) shall be ascertained in accordance with the formula prescribed by the Minister.”. Pindaan seksyen 112"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 112(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “two thousand” dengan perkataan “twenty thousand”. Pindaan seksyen 115"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/19/msa@/~chp_II__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
